   "file": "EpsilonEridani/Mathematics/LinearAlgebra/Alternating/BilinMap.lean",
   "fix": "Rename to `AlternatingMap.neg_bilinMap` and update the two uses in `Polarized/Tensor.lean:197,202` (`\u03b5.bilinMap_neg _` \u2192 `AlternatingMap.neg_bilinMap \u03b5 _`), plus the module-docstring list at line 31.",
